OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest jury finds
OL,4,Aofficials 'erred' over tunnel where he
OL,5,Awas found dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FInquest finds Stormont's Department for
OL,8,FInfrastructure "erred" in its
OL,9,Fmaintenance of a tunnel entrance close
OL,10,Fto where Noah Donohoe was last seen
OL,11,Falive
OL,13,FThe jury also finds that neither the
OL,14,Fdepartment nor the police contributed
OL,15,Fin any way to the schoolboy's death
OL,17,FBut they listed 13 failings by the
OL,18,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,19,Fduring the investigation
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
