OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest jury finds
OL,4,Aofficials 'erred' over tunnel where he
OL,5,Awas found dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 14-year-old went missing after
OL,8,Fleaving his south Belfast home in June
OL,9,F2020, sparking extensive searches
OL,10,Facross the city
OL,12,FHis body was found nearly a week later
OL,13,Fin a tunnel system in north Belfast
OL,15,FA post-mortem examination concluded the
OL,16,Fcause of Noah's death was drowning
OL,18,FThe jury reached a unanimous verdict
OL,19,Fafter five days of deliberations. They
OL,20,Fhad 10 questions to answer
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
